cloud-architecture-diagram

title Calorie Lens Diagram

Input Module {
    Upload [icon: upload]
}

Output Module {
    Telegram Bot [icon: telegram]
}

AWS Cloud [icon: aws] {
    Storage {
        s3 Bucket [icon: aws-s3]
    }
    
    Upload Module {
        API Gateway [icon: aws-api-gateway]
        Upload Service [icon: aws-lambda]
    }
    
    Processing Module {
        Processing Service [icon: aws-lambda]
        Base64 Image [icon: image]
    }
    
    Messaging Module {
        Notification DLQ [icon: aws-sqs]
        Notification Queue [icon: aws-sqs]
        Notification Service [icon: aws-lambda]
    }
    
    Database {
        DynamoDB [icon: aws-dynamodb]
    }
    
    LLM {
        AWS Bedrock [icon: aws-bedrock]
    }
    
    Secrets{
        Parameter Store [icon: aws-ssm]
    }
    
    Logs {
        CloudWatch [icon: aws-cloudwatch]
    }
}

// Upload
Input Module <-> Upload Module : Request
API Gateway <--> Upload Service : Pre-signed URL

// Processing
Processing Module <--> LLM : Invoke Model
Processing Module --> Database : Store Metadata
Processing Service <--> Base64 Image : Convert Image

// Messaging
Processing Module --> Notification Queue : Enqueue Result
Notification Queue --> Notification Service : SQS Event
Notification Queue --> Notification DLQ : Redrive Policy (3 Retries)
Messaging Module <--> LLM : Invoke Model
Messaging Module -> Output Module : Send Message

// Storage
Input Module --> Storage : Upload
Storage --> Processing Module : Object Created

// Secrets
Secrets --> LLM : System Prompt
Secrets --> Messaging Module : Telegram Bot Token

// Logs
Logs -- Upload Module : Logs
Logs -- Messaging Module : Logs
Logs -- Processing Module : Logs
